module tasks.`2026-11-27-spawn-defaults-bboxy-harness`

task SpawnDefaultsBboxyHarness {
  title "Spawn tools default to the bboxy harness; sudo_spawn can choose a harness profile"
  verify $ cargo nextest run -p bboxy450-term-mux -E 'test(spawn_default)'
  paths "crates/bbt-mux/**", "crates/bboxy450-term/**", "crates/bbt-proto/**"
  brief """
    # Spawn defaults

    ROLE: EXECUTOR. Operator, 2026-11-27: "bboxy with codex should be default executor, bboxy harness should be default harness in our system we spawn".
    Create a goal (Codex create_goal) from the outcome and hold it until the verify command exits 0 and the change is on origin/main.

    The prompts already say so (f7b5859af: crates/bbt-mux/src/mcp/seats.rs:82, mcp/sudo.rs:45, crates/bbt-proto/src/gui/roles.rs). The code does not yet.

    ## Outcome
    - seat_spawn, seat_split and sudo_spawn accept a call without approved_profile and start a bboxy450-harness seat.
    - When approved_profile is bboxy450-harness and harness_profile is omitted, the profile follows the role: executor, qa and researcher start on codex; oracle, architect, creativity, solo and sudo start on claude. An explicit harness_profile always wins; a missing profile file is one clear error naming it.
    - sudo_spawn takes harness_profile (today its schema lacks it, so a sudo-spawned harness seat always starts on the harness default, codex: observed 2026-11-25, an Oracle seat came up on Codex).
    - Schemas, descriptions and the role-to-profile rule live in one place; the descriptions stop repeating the rule.

    ## Proof
    Tests named spawn_default_* in crates/bbt-mux/tests: each of the three tools without approved_profile; role-derived profile for an executor and an oracle; explicit profile wins; unknown profile refused. No real agent is started: use the existing launch fixtures.

    Land with make land. Report with reports/2026-11-27-spawn-defaults-bboxy-harness.den.
    """

  managed {
    authorship = json"{\"kind\":\"seat\",\"process_generation\":\"1\",\"public_key\":\"XLMAqZTUlsEIvVxlAso8YDW5Ud3ShPEW3Kz+hD0wm1c=\",\"signer\":\"seat:01M89Z74HN4GSHEPS6TC0H6FDX\"}"
    created = json"\"2026-11-27T17:40:59.875Z\""
